pan>19</span><span>20</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"binding\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:17px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:36px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:55px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:74px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:93px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:112px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:131px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:150px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:169px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:188px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:207px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:226px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:245px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:264px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:283px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:302px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:321px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:340px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:359px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:378px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:397px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:416px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:435px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:454px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:473px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:492px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:511px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:530px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:549px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:568px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:587px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:606px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:625px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:644px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:663px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:682px\"></i>\n    <i class=\"ring\" style=\"top:701px\"></i>\n  </div>\n\n  <header class=\"header\">\n    <div class=\"title-box\">\n      <span class=\"title-tag\">Title</span>\n      <div class=\"title-text\">人民日报金句—清正廉洁篇</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"date-box\">\n      <span class=\"date-tag\">Date</span>\n      <div class=\"date-value\">0/30</div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"content\">\n    <div class=\"watermark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">人民日报金句</div>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e1\">\n      <div class=\"line\">1、<span class=\"soft-mark\">心在正中，不存邪念，是为“忠”</span>；言而能成，<span class=\"soft-mark\">不搞虚假</span>，则为“诚”。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e2\">\n      <div class=\"line\">2、要从一开始就扣好人生的扣子，常怀<span class=\"mark\">感恩之心、敬畏之心、律己之心</span>，</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">常用真善美来雕琢自己，在清廉自守中正心修身、矢志图强。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e3\">\n      <div class=\"line\">3、要树立“君子固穷”的清正意识，以<span class=\"mark\">“澄江静如练”</span>的政治生态涤除心灵的</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">“杂草”</span>；要摒弃奢靡文化的<span class=\"mark\">“灯红酒绿”</span>，摧毁徇私谋利的<span class=\"mark\">“小山头”</span>。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e4\">\n      <div class=\"line\">4、要涵养廉洁自律的道德修为，<span class=\"mark\">心有所畏、言有所戒、行有所止</span>，不断锤</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">炼意志力、坚忍力、自制力，做一个<span class=\"mark\">一心为公、一身正气、一尘不染</span>的人。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e5\">\n      <div class=\"line\">5、青年干部要扣好人生第一粒扣子，坚持吾日三省，在思想上<span class=\"mark\">多照“镜</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">子”、勤清洗“灰尘”、去除“杂质”</span>，自觉同上级要求“对标”，拿党章党规“扫</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">描”，用人民期待“透视”。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e6\">\n      <div class=\"line\">6、“尽小者大，慎微者著”，青年干部要牢记“堤溃蚁孔，气泄针芒”的古训，</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">从日常点滴做起，从一言一行做起。</div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e7\">\n      <div class=\"line\">7、要常怀敬畏之心，自觉防微杜渐，<span class=\"mark\">远离“高压线”、不碰“红线”、坚守“底</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"mark\">线”</span>，把家风建设摆在重要位置，持之以恒净化<span class=\"mark\">“生活圈、交往圈、娱乐圈”</span></div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"entry e8\">\n      <div class=\"line\">8、欲知平直，则必准绳；欲知方圆，则必规矩。无以规矩不成方圆，纪律</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">是衡量D员干部行为的尺子，把纪律当耳旁风必然要付出代价。</div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <div class=\"credit\">Designed by [?]</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
